  m_Name: Text_QuarryWorker_SouthFace_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Odo, the lad I've looked after since we came off the same cart, couldn't leave it alone. He swore you could hear something through that crack at night, slow, like breathing. I told him it was the wind in the rock. He didn't believe me, and I'm not sure I did either.
